    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you send a custom order request, a Quick Order, a class sign-up or a waitlist form, we receive the details you type in, such as your name, email, phone number, event date and order details. We use them only to reply to you and to fill your order. We never sell your information.</p>

    <h2>Forms</h2>
    <p>Our forms are delivered by <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/" rel="noopener">Formspree</a>, which passes your message to us by email and stores a copy in our Formspree account.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>This site uses Google Analytics 4 to understand how many people visit and which pages are useful. Google Analytics uses cookies and collects information such as the pages you view, your general location and the type of device you use. It does not give us your name or contact details. You can learn more in <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a> or opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>.</p>

    <h2>Hosting and site editing</h2>
    <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may log basic technical information such as IP addresses for security. The site's content is edited through Pages CMS, which does not collect information about visitors.</p>

    <h2>Your browser</h2>
    <p>The site remembers in your browser whether you closed the announcement banner. Nothing is sent to us.</p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>Email {{ s.email }} or call {{ s.phone }}.</p>
